. Create new project\n2. Tap in a text edit field like Filter Files\n3. On the android virtual keyboard tap the emoji button next to space bar\n4. Tap on an emoji\n5. Close keyboard\n6. Tap Output tab\n7. Observe the above error messages\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nJust create a new project","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116733/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116733/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}